## What to deliver

Build the crosser up operation by operation until each `frames/<index>.png` matches
the brief: one small, round, warm, big-eyed critter hopping down (0–1), up (2–3),
left (4–5), and right (6–7), each a crouch-then-leap pair, all on full
transparency and reading as harmless prey. When you are satisfied, stop: the
recorded per-frame action logs are your finished submission.
